    "title" : "11 Headland Drive, Long Bay, Auckland - Niseko Real Estate Photographer",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730783703932\" id=\"item-6729a663355ade3546edc846\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-60e0d2064a754671c45f\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us: </strong>PropertyMedia Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Seven Spacious Bedrooms:</strong> Each bedroom provides ample space and comfort, offering private retreats for family members, guests, or even a home office.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Two Modern Bathrooms:</strong> Equipped with quality fixtures, these bathrooms provide functionality and style, ideal for a busy household.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Three Versatile Living Areas:</strong> Perfect for hosting, relaxing, or family gatherings, the three living rooms provide flexibility to meet the needs of a large household.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Functional Kitchen:</strong> The kitchen serves as a central hub with modern appliances and plenty of storage, making cooking for the family a breeze.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage:</strong> Providing secure parking and additional storage, the garage adds to the home's convenience.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Space for Relaxation and Activities:</strong> With plenty of room for outdoor dining, gardening, or play, the backyard complements the spacious indoor areas for a balanced lifestyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Set in a highly sought-after area, 11 Headland offers proximity to local amenities, schools, parks, and shops. This property is a rare find for families looking for a home with room to grow and adapt to their needs while enjoying the best of New Zealand living.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;6729a740b343ad7656e1b7b6&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;6729a740b343ad7656e1b7b6&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730782483469_21026\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"6729a741fff81b66ebad775d\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730783062665-1Z4SAB5WL9ND5DP9A5NR/11+Headland+N